    "title": "Cejudo Edges Walton In Pro Debut - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Boxing Bob Newman ,\n7 hours ago 39-year old Henry Cejudo added “victorious professional boxer” to his illustrious sports resume as he made his professional debut against previously undefeated actor/boxer Javon “Wanna” Walton at the James Knight Convention Center in Miami, Florida tonight. Walton was stepping in for Nurideen “Deen The Great” Shabazz who pulled out two weeks ago. Read full article",
